[Music]  there is one Disney printers missing  from wreck-it Ralph - we love any chance  we get to see our favorite Disney  Princesses on screen so when we spotted  them hanging out in the trailer for  Ralph breaks the Internet wreck-it Ralph  - we were over the moon excited well at  least until we noticed that some beloved  faces were seemingly missing in action  before we let you know who you won't be  seen in the wreck-it ralph sequel hit  the subscribe button for more from the  things if you're following the promos  for wreck-it Ralph - as closely as we  are you probably noticed this one here  we see some of our favorite princesses  surrounding vanellope but there seemed  to be some faces missing from the crowd  we see Jasmine Snow White's Cinderella  and Pocahontas just hanging out then  there is Belle Elsa Anna and even Moana  who is relatively new to the scene  finally we spot Rapunzel Tiana and  Aurora but there are so many more we  don't see naturally this left fans  wondering where the heck is Mulan in  terms of underrated Disney Princesses  many people consider the heroic Milan to  be on top of the list  she took her elderly father's place in  the army rode off to war and saved all  of China and after all that she doesn't  even get to appear in wreck-it Ralph -  alongside all of the other princesses  well put down the pitchforks because  this rumor is thankfully not true it's  been confirmed that her original voice  actor ming-na wen will be reprising her  role as Mulan she's confirmed that we  will have the privilege of seeing Mulan  on screen again and there will be some  hilarious banter between her and the  other princesses there are a few more  missing faces we can lay your fears to  rest about as well Merida from brave and  Ariel from The Little Mermaid are both  absent from this promo video which  seemed like a huge oversight however a  Disney representative has confirmed that  they will both be appearing in the movie  that's definitely her relief 