 released  even its art style makes it stand apart  from the crowd and it's been nominated  for a number of awards it is considered  to be a cult classic but it was never  the commercial success that Disney  wanted it to be people tend to forget  that Keita exists at all and we  definitely won't be seeing her in  wreck-it Ralph too so why did Disney  leave out Meagan Keita is it just  because they don't believe fans would be  excited to see them or is there a deeper  reason we know that these women  definitely stand out but maybe Disney  just doesn't think that they would fit  in with the rest of the princesses for  whatever reason or perhaps they're  powerful and spunky personalities would  overshadow that of the movie star  vanellope whatever the reason we have to  admit that we are more than a little sad  to know that we won't be seeing Keita or  mogera in this movie who is your  favorite Disney Princess and will they  be appearing in the new wreck-it Ralph  movie let us know in the comments  section and then click the subscribe  button to get more videos from the  things thanks for watching and we'll see  you next time  [Music]

